sentences.text:
In the result, I proceed to pass the following:
ORDER i) Appeal is allowed;
NC: 2025:KHC:44597 HC-KAR ii) Order dated 15th July 2025 passed in Spl.
Kiran N S vs State Of Karnataka on 5 November, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/162155816/
4 C.No.9 of 2025 by the Additional District Judge- FTSC-II, Mandya is set aside;
iii) The trial Court is directed to release the appellant/accused No.4 forthwith;
iv) Appellant shall abide by the conditions which were imposed at the time of granting bail by the trial Court;
v) It is made clear that this court has not expressed any opinion on the merits of the case.

